    - target: {fileID: 4311554487604352476, guid: ccf987cd10914a55b3c0d5a642771d6c,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[2].Body
      value: Apparently people didn't like the new offers I did
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311554487604352476, guid: ccf987cd10914a55b3c0d5a642771d6c,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[3].Body
      value: Anyways, if you have some aeos gems left I can give you the good stuff
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311554487604352476, guid: ccf987cd10914a55b3c0d5a642771d6c,
